<h1 id=\"fact-ultrafilters-product-—-Ultrafilter-Product\">fact-ultrafilters-product — Ultrafilter Product</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}ultrafilters\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),T;\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\phi\\in T\\;\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\phi\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}ultrafilters\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),T;\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\phi\\in T\\;\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\phi\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the theory-level form of Łoś's theorem. An arbitrary ultraproduct is not in general an elementary extension of each individual factor.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-ultrafilters-product-—-Ultrafilter-Product","text":"fact-ultrafilters-product — Ultrafilter Product","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"35ef9870c318436f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-ultraproduct-